        {
            "key": "seo_faqs",
            "scope": "seo-services",
            "items": [
                [
                    "What is included in your SEO services?",
                    "A technical audit to begin with, then keyword and content strategy, on-page optimisation, content production, link building, and monthly reporting. The technical fixes get implemented by our own developers rather than handed back to you as a to-do list. Scope is agreed upfront, based on what you are trying to achieve."
                ],
                [
                    "What engagement models do you offer for SEO outsourcing?",
                    "Four models: FTE / Retainership (a fixed monthly cost), GCC (a Build, Operate, Deliver approach), Transaction (pay on invoice), and One-time / Milestone-based. How you work with us depends on what you need."
                ],
                [
                    "How is your SEO outsourcing model different from hiring a freelancer or building an in-house team?",
                    "Our 100% in-house team gives you senior expertise without the cost of hiring. We do not outsource further or engage freelancers, the same or similarly skilled resources work on your account every time, and a dedicated project manager is your point of contact."
                ],
                [
